WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.390
- [Kelly] Well, I saw this video

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:02.920
it's the whole cast and it went viral.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.110
So I wanna show everybody this.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.080
So, what was going on here?

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.179
This was impromptu, look at Sterling!

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:10.120
(audience laughs)

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.840
- This was like us on a break.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.740
So we had like all this time,
this was like a 18-hour day.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.350
And we were there from six o'clock,

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.783
look at the booties

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:21.990
- Look at the booties.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.780
- We were there from
like, I think I got there

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:24.613
at eight o'clock in the morning.

00:00:24.613 --> 00:00:26.500
I remember leaving just
after midnight, but

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.400
we were all there and we were shooting

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.470
Kate's second wedding to Phil and

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.620
a wonderful person who runs our social

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.740
Sarah Warehime came in, she
always has ideas for us to do.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.560
And she was coming to
Sterling with something.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.550
And I think between her
and Sterling, they came up

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.420
with this idea and he was
asking me about music choices.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.610
And I was like, oh, you should
do something that people

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.310
would play at a barbecue.
Everybody can dance.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:48.143
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:48.143 --> 00:00:49.000
- And he came up with the wobble

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.671
and then he taught everybody.

00:00:50.671 --> 00:00:52.061
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:52.061 --> 00:00:52.894
- And you know, I was

00:00:52.894 --> 00:00:53.727
- Except for Mr. Hartley.

00:00:53.727 --> 00:00:54.750
He's just chilling on
the couch on the phone

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.021
- See, he knows his position.

00:00:57.021 --> 00:00:58.367
He's knows. He's like

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.120
"I know my lane, I'ma be here."

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.540
- [Kelly] Does he not dance?

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:02.430
Is this what it is?

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.263
- No ma'am. He just

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.096
- No, ma'am good.

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.140
- And listen, does he not do it well?

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:07.973
Did he not do that well?

00:01:07.973 --> 00:01:10.330
- He did it well, I love it
he is just on the phone, like

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.820
He's making deals while
everyone's dancing, I love it.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.480
I was like, "that just
means he don't dance"

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.605
And that's what we do on our break.

00:01:17.605 --> 00:01:18.931
That was like a break.

00:01:18.931 --> 00:01:20.810
And, and we were, you
know, it's the way to like

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.610
just kinda get through the day.

